{
  "id": "JHN.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 20",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaliel m'ongoye gimoro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I Sabiti odikin worwor, mafodi piny riprip, Maria ma wok Magdala okidho kaliel to neno ni oŋil woko tele ma dhok kaliel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oringo to kidho bongi Simon Petero kodi jafonjirok man ma Yesu omaro, to waco rijo ni, “Jokwanyo woko Rwoth i kaliel aka wakuya kam'oketh'iye go!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Petero gi jafonjirok man no joay to jokidho i kaliel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jario no oyido joringo, to jafonjirok man no odwire oyombo Petero to telo tundo i kaliel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oluŋere to neno sukin ama odoŋ, to k'odonjo i iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon Petero oluwo go cen to donjo i kaliel, to neno sukin no kenyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi nanga m'onwaŋo otwey gine wiy Yesu m'odole gicen kakende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo, jafonjirok, m'otelo tundo i kaliel bende odonjo to neno to yeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Jono fodi oyido jok'oniaŋ odoco kwoŋ randik ma waco ni go ripo cerino). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jofonjirok no jodok peco pajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu menyere ri Maria Magadalina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maria ocungo munyo ywak dho thengi kaliel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gikenyo go oneno jomalaika ario kenyo, i nangin matar, ma jobedo piny kam'onwaŋo oketh'iye delkwoŋ Yesu, acel yuwiye, man yu tiende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jopenjo go ni, “Dhakodwoŋ, iywaki aŋo?” Go odwoko ni, “Jokwanyo Rwoth paran, aka akuya kama joketh'iye go!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo go otieko waco ameno, go owire to neno Yesu ocungo kenyo; to k'oŋeyo ni manago Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu openjo go ni, “Dhakodwoŋ, raŋo iywaki. Raŋo ŋa?” Paka dheno oparo ni meno won ndelo, owaco rigo ni, “K'iŋati ikwanyo go, jadwoŋ, waci ran kam'iketh'iye go akidhi aom go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco rigo ni, “Maria!” Go owire yubonge to waco gi Dhohiburu ni, “Raboni!” (Dwoŋ mere ni Jafonji.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco rigo ni, “Ikir'imakan rupiri fodi akigiki bongi Baba. To kidhi bongi wutmera iwaci rijo ni akidho malo bongi Baba ma Bawin, Were paran ma Were mewin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Maria Magadalina owaco ri jofonjirok pere ni, “Atieko neno Rwoth.” To liesa rijo gima Yesu owaco rigo je.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu menyere ri jofonjirok pere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo piny oumere i ndelo ma Sabiti no, jofonjirok oyido jocokere kanyacel kareno jocego thigin, rupiri oyido jolworo Joyuda. Gikenyo Yesu obino to cungo i dier jo to waco ni, “Siem wobedi kodi win.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo go otieko waco ameno, onyutho jo cinge gi ŋete. Jofonjirok kisangala opoŋ i cuny jo munyo joneno Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu odoko owaco rijo ni, “Siem wobedi kodi win. Paka Baba ooran abende aoro win.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go owaco gime to kudho jo gi luya to waco ni, “Limi win Cuny Maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.16.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 16:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.18.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reco pa ji ma winocwaki rijo, ibino cwako rijo; to reco pa ji ma wik'ocwaki rijo bende k'ocwaki rijo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kodi Toma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acel kwoŋ jofonjirok, Toma (m'ilwoŋo ni Rut) onwaŋo ongoye bongi jo munyo Yesu obino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jofonjirok wadi jowaci rigo ni, “Watieko neno Rwoth!” Toma owaco rijo ni, “K'akineno waŋpoyo ma musumal oweyo i cinge, t'arwako lwetan kama musumal odonj'iye i ŋete, ak'oyey.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ndelo abirio okadho, jofonjirok oyido jonitie kanyacel kendo, aka Toma oyido nigi jo. Thigin je oyido ocegi, to Yesu obino to cungo i dier jo to waco rijo ni, “Siem wobedi gi win.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo go owaco ri Toma ni, “Rwaki lwetin ka, aka neni cingan; odoko keli cingin irwaki i ŋetan bende. Ikir'ibedi gi kiganagana, to bedi gi yeyo ayin!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toma odwoko ni, “Rwoth paran kendo Were paran!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:29"
